<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>For You ♡</title>

<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Baloo+2:wght@400;600&display=swap');

* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  font-family: 'Baloo 2', cursive;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  min-height: 100vh;
  background: url('https://i.imgur.com/9Xn0WZQ.png');
  background-size: cover;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
}

.card {
  width: 90%;
  max-width: 390px;
  background: #fff;
  border-radius: 26px;
  padding: 22px;
  border: 4px dashed #ffc1d9;
  text-align: center;
  display: none;
}

.card.active {
  display: block;
}

.image-box {
  background: #ffe3ef;
  border-radius: 18px;
  padding: 10px;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}

.image-box img {
  width: 100%;
  border-radius: 14px;
}

h1 {
  color: #ff8fb8;
  font-size: 26px;
  margin: 8px 0;
}

p {
  color: #555;
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

button {
  margin-top: 14px;
  padding: 12px 22px;
  border-radius: 22px;
  border: none;
  font-size: 15px;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.pink {
  background: #ff9ebd;
  color: white;
}

.green {
  background: #7fe0c4;
  color: white;
  margin-left: 8px;
}

.gray {
  background: #ffd1e1;
  color: #444;
}

.letter {
  max-height: 280px;
  overflow-y: auto;
  text-align: left;
  padding-right: 6px;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<!-- SCREEN 1 -->
<div class="card active" id="s1">
  <div class="image-box">
    <img src="https://i.imgur.com/Y6bKZ6N.png">
  </div>
  <h1>happy monthsary baby</h1>
  <p>(๑•ᴗ•๑)</p>
  <p>Click the next button!! (っ◕‿◕)っ♥</p>
  <button class="pink" onclick="go(2)">Next!! ~w~</button>
</div>

<!-- SCREEN 2 -->
<div class="card" id="s2">
  <div class="image-box">
    <img src="https://i.imgur.com/6RL9Z0c.png">
  </div>
  <p>Do you want to open it?</p>
  <p>"(≧▢≦)ノ"</p>
  <button class="pink" onclick="go(4)">Open it</button>
  <button class="green" onclick="go(3)">No ty</button>
</div>

<!-- SCREEN 3 -->
<div class="card" id="s3">
  <div class="image-box">
    <img src="https://i.imgur.com/0y8Ftya.png">
  </div>
  <p>that made me sad (｡•́︿•̀｡)</p>
  <button class="gray" onclick="go(2)">Again</button>
</div>

<!-- SCREEN 4 -->
<div class="card" id="s4">
  <h1>for you ♡</h1>
  <div class="letter">
    <p>
      I remember the time when I wasn't looking for love. I was focused on getting through my days and figuring things out on my own but then you came into my life and everything felt different and that makes it special. I can't imagine my life without you, sinanay mo kong nanjan ka palagi para sakin.
      <br><br>
      I'm very grateful to have you and how perfectly unexpected you are. Loving you wasn’t something I chased, it simply happened, and it feels real in a way nothing else ever did.
      <br><br>
      When life isn't being kind to you, always remember na nandito lang ako palagi kasama mo. You don't have to face it alone, we'll face it together, ga. I love you, forever.
      <br><br>
      Love,<br>
      <strong>AD</strong>
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
function go(n) {
  document.querySelectorAll('.card').forEach(c => c.classList.remove('active'));
  document.getElementById('s' + n).classList.add('active');
}
</script>

</body>
</html>
